boo tiles concentrate on B7-B8-B9 which can form a complete chow. Discarding B1 maintains maximum flexibility for both my Character tiles (W2-W4 waiting for W3, W7 pair) and my Bamboo sequence (B7-B8-B9). This keeps the most winning possibilities open.\n\nAnswer: Play B1"}
