ot contribute to any meld formation. The Dots suit (B4, B6, B7, B8, B9x2) offers the best potential for forming multiple melds, especially if I draw B5. Keeping W4 and W7 pairs provides flexibility for the final pair or potential pung.\n\nAnswer: Play T4"}
